Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.12,Alice,Alice,0,0,0,,Good morning\Neveryone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.20,Alice,Alice,0,0,0,,Let's start the\Nweekly sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.50,0:00:06.00,Dumindu,Dumindu,0,0,0,,{\fnSinhala Sangam MN}ආයුබෝවන්, අද රැස්වීමේ කාර්ය\N{\fnSinhala Sangam MN}සූචිය බලමු.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:08.00,Dumindu,Dumindu,0,0,0,,{\fnSinhala Sangam MN}මම හොඳින්, ස්තුතියි.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:10.74,Alice,Alice,0,0,0,,The quarterly\Nnumbers look good,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:12.60,Alice,Alice,0,0,0,,but we need to\Nimprove the Sinhala
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:13.13,Alice,Alice,0,0,0,,transcription\Naccuracy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:14.21,Alice,Alice,0,0,0,,especially for\Nnames.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.54,Dumindu,Dumindu,0,0,0,,Agreed. I'll review\Nthe rules with Zoom
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.62,0:00:18.00,Dumindu,Dumindu,0,0,0,,& Teams <beta> next\Nweek.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:27.02,Alice,Alice,0,0,0,,After a long pause:\Na quote "hello",
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:28.10,Alice,Alice,0,0,0,,and a comma.
